WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:03.879
Click at the Overview tab at the top of
your course dashboard.

cue-2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.939
Here you can have an aerial view of your
course pages, individual students,

cue-3
00:00:09.939 --> 00:00:12.619
assessment scores, and recommended
actions.

cue-4
00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:17.979
If you navigate to the Students tab, it
will give you a full roster of your

cue-5
00:00:17.979 --> 00:00:18.979
enrolled students.

cue-6
00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:25.479
You can use the search feature and
progress and proficiency level to locate

cue-7
00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:26.399
certain students

cue-8
00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:29.719
or filter by student types on the
right-hand side.

cue-9
00:00:30.659 --> 00:00:35.520
For example, I want to see for those who
have mostly completed the activities what

cue-10
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.860
their common mistakes are.

cue-11
00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:43.720
Then, I can select progress greater or
equal than 90% and proficiency medium and

cue-12
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.139
low.

cue-13
00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:52.439
To view individual student insight, click
on the student. You will have a more

cue-14
00:00:52.439 --> 00:00:54.099
detailed information breakdown.

cue-15
00:00:55.719 --> 00:01:01.040
Go to their Progress tab. You can then
select or search for a specific page or

cue-16
00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:01.700
activity.

cue-17
00:01:03.279 --> 00:01:07.359
After you click on the page, you will see
the student's attempt history.

cue-18
00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:13.379
This includes number of attempts, when
they started each attempt, and when they

cue-19
00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:19.899
submitted it for scored activities. Click
into one attempt to see the student's

cue-20
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:26.260
answers and how each response was
evaluated. This view can help you identify

cue-21
00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.959
where a student may have misunderstood a
concept or whether they need support or

cue-22
00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:33.399
additional attempts.
